## Attribution

> Data from Slovenia Fuel Range by Luka Prebil Grintal, licensed under CC BY
> 4.0. Derived from the ARSO/MOPE model list, gov.si petroleum product prices,
> SURS electricity prices, the Petrol charging price list, AMZS Motorevija
> sales figures, a Delo estimate of the fleet by model, ADAC Autokatalog
> figures for older generations, and OSRM road distances. Consumption figures
> converted from NEDC to WLTP with a factor of 1.21.

## What the upstream sources require

- ARSO/MOPE and gov.si publish under CC BY 4.0. Their attribution is required in
  any reuse and is kept per row in `data/curated.csv` and per file in
  `data/catalogue.json` and `data/prices.json`.
- SURS, Petrol, AMZS, Delo and ADAC figures are quoted facts with the source
  named in the same files. Neither the original publishers nor the sources list
  endorse this project.
- The fleet by model in panel B is an estimate, not official statistics. Do not
  present it as a SURS dataset.
